# Pinned toolchain for building Punch. The Crystal release, with its own
# standard library. Move the pin deliberately, and the checksums with it:
# the SHA-256 of each release archive scripts/setup-toolchain.sh (and an
# app's devcontainer) installs, as the release's assets list them.
